Keybindings | ctrl+shift+w | close_surface
Keybindings | ctrl+shift+n | new_window
Keybindings | ctrl+shift+q | quit
Keybindings | ctrl+shift+c | copy_to_clipboard
Keybindings | ctrl+shift+v | paste_from_clipboard
Keybindings | ctrl+shift+r | reload_config
Keybindings | ctrl+shift+z | toggle_fullscreen
Keybindings | shift+enter | text:\x1b\r
